# Recipe 11.3 - Custom macro file + /reloadmacros
# Goal: author a project macro set and reload it at runtime.
# Run: /script doc/cookbook/11_3_custom_macros.chatdsl
# Requires: a file my_macros.chatdsl in the working directory containing a def my_review(language) = "..."

/reloadmacros my_macros.chatdsl
/filebank1 some_code.py
/model mistral_1
%my_review(python)
Review the code in {filebank1} for bugs.
/save 11_3_review.txt
